---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Client Portal
lang: en
description: The Foreign Immigration Services Client Portal is in development. Learn what is available now and what is planned.
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
<section class="section trust-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="trust-section__inner">
      {{ icon("portal-enquiry", 52) }}
      <div>
        <p class="tag">Client Portal</p>
        <h1>A Secure Digital Service Hub, Built in Stages</h1>
        <p>Foreign Immigration Services is developing a secure Client Portal to provide clients with direct channels for enquiries, document submission, application tracking and payments. Rather than launch incomplete functionality, each capability below goes live only once it is genuinely operational. Current status is set out honestly below.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("portal-enquiry", 44) }}
        <p class="tag tag--available">Available now, interim</p>
        <h3>Send an Enquiry</h3>
        <p>A dedicated enquiry system is in development. Until it is available, you can reach us directly by email.</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/contact/">Go to Contact →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card card--muted">
        {{ icon("portal-upload", 44) }}
        <p class="tag">Not yet available</p>
        <h3>Document Upload</h3>
        <p>Secure document upload is planned for a future release, once storage, retention and privacy safeguards have been finalised. This feature is not yet operational.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card card--muted">
        {{ icon("portal-track", 44) }}
        <p class="tag">Not yet available</p>
        <h3>Track Your Enquiry</h3>
        <p>Enquiry tracking will be introduced alongside our secure client system. This feature is not yet operational.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card card--muted">
        {{ icon("portal-track", 44) }}
        <p class="tag">Not yet available</p>
        <h3>Track Your Application / Transaction</h3>
        <p>Application and transaction tracking will be introduced alongside our secure client system. This feature is not yet operational.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card card--notice">
        {{ icon("portal-payments", 44) }}
        <p class="tag">Not yet available</p>
        <h3>Payments</h3>
        <p>Payments are accepted after the scope of services and applicable fees have been confirmed by our team.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
